Subject: [PATCH] kernel: fix b44 fixed PHY dependency for 7.4

The Linux 7.4 Broadcom b44 driver uses the fixed PHY module.
Select the 7.4 conditional dependency so kmod-b44 declares fixed_phy.ko.

--- a/package/kernel/linux/modules/netdevices.mk
+++ b/package/kernel/linux/modules/netdevices.mk
@@ -1603,1 +1603,1 @@
-  DEPENDS:=@PCI_SUPPORT @!TARGET_bcm47xx_mips74k +!TARGET_bcm47xx:kmod-ssb +kmod-mii +kmod-libphy +LINUX_7_3:kmod-fixed-phy
+  DEPENDS:=@PCI_SUPPORT @!TARGET_bcm47xx_mips74k +!TARGET_bcm47xx:kmod-ssb +kmod-mii +kmod-libphy +LINUX_7_4:kmod-fixed-phy
